# Local development variables/secrets for `wrangler dev`.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored) and adjust the values.
# Anything defined here is loaded as an `env` binding during local development,
# keeping values out of the public repository.
#
# Comma-separated list of exact origins allowed to read API responses
# cross-origin. Leave empty (or omit) to disable CORS.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS="http://localhost:5173"
